## block elements go on their own lines, inline ones stay in the text
<div><p>Some <b>bold</b> and <a href="/x">linked</a> text, long enough that it has to wrap at some point because it does not fit.</p><ul><li>one</li><li>two</li></ul></div>

## attributes break one per line when they do not fit
<img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 400 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | escape }}" width="400" height="300" loading="lazy" class="card__image">
<a   class="a"   href="/x" >x</a>
<input type="checkbox" checked disabled>
<br/><hr><custom-element some-attribute></custom-element>

## attributes that were on several lines stay on several lines
<div
  class="a" id="b">x</div>

## the value of an attribute is kept as written
<div class="a  {{ b }}   c" data-x='{"a": 1}' style="color: red;margin:0" data-y=unquoted {{ block.shopify_attributes }}></div>
<div class="
      a
   b
      {% if c %}d{% endif %}
"></div>

## liquid among attributes
<div {% if a %}class="b"{% endif %} id="c"></div>
<option value="1"{% if selected %} selected{% endif %}>x</option>

## whitespace that shows in the page is kept
<span>a</span><span>b</span> <span>c</span>
<p>text<b>bold</b>text {{ a }}{{ b }} {{ c }}</p>
<button>   Click   </button><label>Name<input></label>

## a long line of inline elements borrows the brackets of its tags
<p>A paragraph with <a href="https://example.com/a/very/long/url/that/goes/on/and/on">a link whose text is long</a><b>and bold right after it</b><i>then italic, with no space between them anywhere</i>.</p>

## pre and textarea are left alone
<pre>
  kept   as
      written
</pre>
<textarea>
  also   kept
</textarea>

## comments
<!--   a comment   -->
<!--
    on several
  lines
-->
<!--[if lt IE 9]><p>old</p><![endif]-->

## prettier-ignore
<!-- prettier-ignore -->
<div   class="kept"   >   as   written   </div>
{% # prettier-ignore %}
{{ kept|as:written }}
<!-- prettier-ignore-attribute -->
<div   class="a"   id="b">formatted   inside</div>

## what a comment says of the next element
<!-- display: inline -->
<div>a</div><!-- display: block -->
<span>b</span>
<!-- white-space: pre -->
<div>  kept  </div>

## the doctype, html, head and body
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="{{ request.locale.iso_code }}"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>{{ page_title }}</title>{{ content_for_header }}</head><body class="a">{{ content_for_layout }}</body></html>

## tables, lists and selects break their children
<table><thead><tr><th>a</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>b</td><td>c</td></tr></tbody></table>
<select name="a"><option value="1">one</option><option value="2" selected>two</option></select>

## an element opened in one branch and closed in another
{% if a %}<div class="a">{% else %}<div class="b">{% endif %}
content
</div>

## an element named with liquid
<{{ tag }} class="a">x</{{ tag }}>
<h{{ level }}>title</h{{ level }}>

## svg is left alone
<svg viewBox="0 0 10 10"   width="10"><path   d="M0 0L10 10"/>
  <circle r="1"/></svg>

